{% comment %}
  Line icon set (currentColor). Generic icons come from the client's icon library
  (Figma "Zenith Revamp 2026" → Icons, Untitled-UI style, 24×24, 2px stroke).
  Accepts: icon {String}, class {String} optional
  Usage: {% render 'zenith-icon', icon: 'shield' %}

  Swap an icon: copy the library SVG's path "d", drop its stroke/stroke-width/linecap/linejoin
  attributes (the wrapper sets stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" round caps/joins — brand.md: thin 1.5px line icons; the library files are drawn at 2).

  name → library file
    star               Shapes/star-01.svg
    play               Media & devices/play.svg
    check              General/check.svg
    check_circle       General/check-circle.svg
    shield             Security/shield-tick.svg
    truck              Maps & travel/truck-01.svg
    cash               Finance & eCommerce/bank-note-02.svg
    certified          Education/award-03.svg
    flag               Maps & travel/flag-01.svg
    refresh            Arrows/refresh-cw-01.svg
    lock               Security/lock-01.svg
    box                Development/package.svg
    droplet            Editor/drop.svg
    shield_plus        Security/shield-plus.svg
    thermometer        Weather/thermometer-02.svg
    sun                Weather/sun.svg
    badge_check_round  General/check-verified-01.svg
    hand_heart         General/heart-hand.svg
    sun_cloud          Weather/cloud-sun-02.svg
    clock              Time/clock.svg
    user               Users/user-01.svg
    chat               Communication/message-square-01.svg
    gift               Finance & eCommerce/gift-01.svg
    arrow_left         Arrows/arrow-left.svg
    arrow_right        Arrows/arrow-right.svg
    plus               General/plus.svg
    sparkles           Weather/stars-02.svg
    book_open          Education/book-open-01.svg
    chevron_right      Arrows/chevron-right.svg
    chevron_left       Arrows/chevron-left.svg
    cart               Finance & eCommerce/shopping-cart-01.svg
    close              General/x-close.svg
    phone              Communication/phone.svg
    qr                 Development/qr-code-02.svg
    badge_check        General/check-verified-02.svg
    pin                Maps & travel/marker-pin-01.svg
    phone_call         Communication/phone-call-01.svg
    chevron_down       Arrows/chevron-down.svg
    mail               Communication/mail-01.svg
    mail_open          Communication/mail-02.svg
    link               General/link-01.svg
    minus              General/minus.svg
    thumbs_up          Alerts & feedback/thumbs-up.svg
    certificate        Education/certificate-01.svg
    dropper            Editor/dropper.svg
    map                Maps & travel/map-01.svg
  Kept (custom / no library equivalent): verified_seal, lazada, shopee, tiktok_shop, instagram,
    facebook, linkedin, x (brand logos), check_filled (filled disc with cut-out check),
    pause (filled bars; library only has pause-circle), leaf, farm (no library equivalent).
{% endcomment %}
{%- liquid
  assign classes = 'zenith-icon'
  if class != blank
    assign classes = classes | append: ' ' | append: class
  endif
-%}
